          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 34,
              "Title": "Simply Dial Zero",
              "Text": "Our reception team is here to assist you with any enquiry, big or small.\nFrom arranging transport to recommending nearby attractions, simply **dial ‘0’** from your room phone or drop by the desk.\n\nShould you require special assistance - such as accessibility services, medical support, or travel arrangements - for the duration of your stay, please let us know, and we will be delighted to help.\n\n\n#### **Additional Services Available:**\n\n- Restaurant Reservations: We’re happy to recommend and book tables at local eateries or at our in-house dining venues.\n- Spa & Wellness Bookings: Unwind with relaxing treatments—let us organize your spa appointments.\n- Wake-up Calls: Let our team ensure you're awake and refreshed for any early commitments or excursions.\n- Room Supplies: From extra pillows to toiletries, simply inform us, and we’ll promptly deliver items to your room.\n- Luggage Assistance: Need help with your luggage on arrival or departure? Just dial ‘0’ and assistance will be provided swiftly.\n\n\nWe’re here to make your stay comfortable, memorable, and worry-free. \n\n#### **Simply dial ‘0’ anytime!**",
              "Media": null,
              "Photoslider": null
            }
          ]
